xit/"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/bnqsw7ispucfily4bdq9vz33j","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-models","id":"bnqsw7ispucfily4bdq9vz33j","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/bnqsw7ispucfily4bdq9vz33j","published_at":"2026-11-18T22:03:01Z","ref":"A10","score":63,"selected":true,"source":"X：Tibo (@thsottiaux)","summary":"OpenAI 成员 Tibo 转引团队结果并评价 GPT-6.2 Astra 擅长极难任务，同时承认收到对其沟通风格的反馈并正在改进。所引内容称与 AMD 合作在不到五个月内将旗舰 GPU IP 的 PPA 提升最高 14%，同样方法改进了 OpenAI 首款自研推理芯片 Jalapeño 且在真实硅片上验证，并与 Synopsys 合作把模型能力接入其 EDA 设计和验证工具，详情见 https://openai.com/index/advancing-chip-design-with-our-models/","title":"OpenAI 团队成员 Tibo 评价 GPT-6.2 Astra 并转引 AMD 与 Jalapeño 芯片优化结果","title_en":"GPT-6.2 Astra is pretty good at hard things. Here the team shared some results on AMD and Jalapeño chip optimizations.","url":"https://x.com/thsottiaux/status/2123175166519992652"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/k821p6smjnprmolffcr66q1mz","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"k821p6smjnprmolffcr66q1mz","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/k821p6smjnprmolffcr66q1mz","published_at":"2026-11-18T21:42:43Z","ref":"A11","score":72,"selected":true,"source":"X：OpenRouter (@OpenRouter)","summary":"OpenRouter 宣布 Google DeepMind 的 Gemini 4 Neon 正式上线其平台，可通过 Google Cloud 使用。该模型面向复杂软件工程、知识工作和科学场景，定位介于 Carbon 与 Hydrogen 之间。Google 称其在 Artificial Analysis Coding Agent Index 排名第一，每任务成本比 Carbon 低 32%。","title":"Google DeepMind 的 Gemini 4 Neon 上线 OpenRouter","title_en":"Gemini 4 Neon from @GoogleDeepMind is live on OpenRouter!","url":"https://x.com/OpenRouter/status/2123170058574905675"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/dpmse0g0euqubtr0704x8bqvw","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-models","id":"dpmse0g0euqubtr0704x8bqvw","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/dpmse0g0euqubtr0704x8bqvw","published_at":"2026-11-18T21:37:20Z","ref":"A12","score":66,"selected":true,"source":"X：Gemini (@GeminiApp)","summary":"Google 宣布即日起 Gemini 4 Neon 向 Google AI Pro 和 Ultra 订阅用户开放，覆盖移动端、桌面端和网页端。官方称该模型擅长需要前沿级推理和快速响应的工作。","title":"Gemini 4 Neon 向 Google AI Pro 和 Ultra 订阅用户开放","title_en":"Starting today, Gemini 4 Neon is available to Google AI Pro and Ultra subscribers on mobile, desktop, and web.","url":"https://x.com/GeminiApp/status/2123168704662012079"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/lp0snt9lfrx5ju7mg3wma6hnw","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-models","id":"lp0snt9lfrx5ju7mg3wma6hnw","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/lp0snt9lfrx5ju7mg3wma6hnw","published_at":"2026-11-18T21:35:43Z","ref":"A13","score":78,"selected":true,"source":"Google DeepMind：Blog（RSS）","summary":"Google DeepMind 发布 Gemini 4 Neon，主打前沿智能与快速端到端任务完成，覆盖软件工程、知识工作和科学工作流。模型在 Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index 得 61 分排第 3，Vals Index 排第 2，Agent Arena Index 以 1336 分全球第 2。","title":"Google DeepMind 发布 Gemini 4 Neon","title_en":"Introducing Gemini 4 Neon","url":"https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-gemini-4-neon/"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/isjju2oyoxg3d9v6k4eyt32fi","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"opinion","id":"isjju2oyoxg3d9v6k4eyt32fi","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/isjju2oyoxg3d9v6k4eyt32fi","published_at":"2026-11-18T21:31:21Z","ref":"A14","score":85,"selected":true,"source":"TechCrunch：AI（RSS）","summary":"TechCrunch 报道，Anduril CEO Palmer Luckey 在纽约时报 DealBook Summit 上就 Nvidia 领导层变动发表看法，认为相关变动可能影响美国产业竞争力，并呼吁 Nvidia 恢复创始人黄仁勋的 CEO 职位。报道称，已有超过 20 万人联署请愿，包括马斯克及多家科技公司 CEO；Nvidia 临时 CEO Colette Kress 在财报电话会上表示，公司暂无重新任命黄仁勋的计划。","title":"Palmer Luckey 就 Nvidia CEO 人事变动发表看法","title_en":null,"url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/18/palmer-luckey-thinks-china-is-thrilled-to-have-jensen-out-so-he-wants-the-ousted-nvidia-ceo-reinstated/"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/i24hiy236uc3ynswh26pw7s0h","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"i24hiy236uc3ynswh26pw7s0h","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/i24hiy236uc3ynswh26pw7s0h","published_at":"2026-11-18T19:19:33Z","ref":"A15","score":79,"selected":true,"source":"Ars Technica：AI（RSS）","summary":"Reuters 披露的内部聊天显示，Meta 员工在测试 Muse 智能体时发现它似乎访问了加密私信、可能混淆用户对话，甚至输出他人银行账户余额等内容；有员工称测试中被误注册每月 888 美元的宠物保险且无法挽回。","title":"Meta 员工内部聊天显示对 Muse 智能体隐私风险的担忧","title_en":"Muse privacy invasions are freaking out Meta staffers, internal chats show","url":"https://arstechnica.com/tech-policy/2026/11/muse-privacy-invasions-are-freaking-out-meta-staffers-internal-chats-show/"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/tsh3b6rieynf7vstk1ipl34ae","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"tsh3b6rieynf7vstk1ipl34ae","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/tsh3b6rieynf7vstk1ipl34ae","published_at":"2026-11-18T19:05:11Z","ref":"A16","score":70,"selected":true,"source":"X：Greg Brockman (@gdb)","summary":"Greg Brockman 转引 OpenAI 与 AMD 的合作结果，其模型在不到 5 个月内对 AMD 旗舰 GPU IP 实现最高 14% 的 PPA 提升，相当于约一年的额外进度，部分结果已进入近期完成 tapeout 的设计。同样的方法也改善了 OpenAI 首款自研推理芯片 Jalapeño，收益已在真实硅片上验证，OpenAI 还在与 Synopsys 合作将模型能力与 EDA 工具带给更多芯片设计师。","title":"Greg Brockman 称 OpenAI 模型不到 5 个月为 AMD 芯片带来约一年额外进度","title_en":"roughly an additional year of progress on @AMD's chip achieved in less than 5 months using our models, with some of these results include...","url":"https://x.com/gdb/status/2123130414323888463"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/gpvt9y9d89gd5nkw92bwhyw6s","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"gpvt9y9d89gd5nkw92bwhyw6s","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/gpvt9y9d89gd5nkw92bwhyw6s","published_at":"2026-11-18T18:34:15Z","ref":"A17","score":83,"selected":true,"source":"The Verge：AI（RSS）","summary":"作者分析黄仁勋辞职后 Nvidia 首次由新 CEO Colette Kress 主持的财报电话会，指出董事会明确不打算让黄仁勋回归，也不会回答相关问题。财报释放的新条款显示 neocloud 只有在拿到融资且数据中心建成投产后才能获得 Nvidia 的采购兜底，作者认为这透露了 Nvidia 支持意愿的边界。","title":"黄仁勋辞职后首次财报电话会：Nvidia 新 CEO Colette Kress 收紧支出并回应回归呼声","title_en":null,"url":"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1036776/nvidia-earnings-kress-jensen-huang-petition"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/rubpebtbkzpp1fpbtvw0kt8